---
import { DEMO } from '../config';
import HotelierMark from './brand/HotelierMark.astro';
import TattvaMark from './brand/TattvaMark.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<section class="notes" id="notes" aria-label="Notes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ol>
      <li>{DEMO.hotelName} is a sample property. Every booking, figure, chart and rate on this page is illustrative, computed the same way HotelierOS computes them from live reservations.</li>
      <li>The pricing shown is a teaser demand curve. The live model controls for season, day of week, lead time and logged competitor rates.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
<footer>
  <div class="wrap foot-inner">
    <span class="foot-by"><HotelierMark /> HotelierOS by <a href="https://tattvalabs.io">Tattva Labs</a></span>
    <span class="foot-copy">© {year} <TattvaMark /> <a href="https://tattvalabs.io">Tattva Labs</a></span>
  </div>
</footer>
